  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">STRENGTHENING LONG-TERM PROTECTION OF ELEPHANTS IN SOUTHERN TANZANIA - 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE GOAL OF THIS PROJECT IS TO FURTHER ENHANCE LONG-TERM SECURITY OF ELEPHANTS IN THE RUAHA-RUNGWAECOSYSTEM OF SOUTHERN TANZANIA AND THEREBY HELP CONSERVE ONE OF EAST AFRICAS LARGEST ELEPHANTPOPULATIONS. THE GEOGRAPHIC SCOPE OF THIS PROJECT COVERS RUAHA NATIONAL PARK, RUNGWA-KIZIGO-MUHESIGAME RESERVES, AND MBOMIPA WILDLIFE MANAGEMENT AREA (WMA).</narrative>
  </description>
